    "long_instructions": "# App Build & Test\r\n\r\nUse Web Lab to build, test, and refine your app as it evolves throughout the milestones.\r\n\r\nThis is the primary workspace for your app. Your work here will carry forward into the next Web Lab levels, where you will continue to iterate and refine your app.\r\n\r\nTo get started, open `capstone.md` and fill in what you know so far:\r\n- Your app idea and audience\r\n- The scop of this version - what's in and what's out\r\n- The main user interaction you planned in Milestones 1 and 2\r\n\r\nThen use AI Tutor to begin building. Upload your sketches from your Backpack to give AI Tutor context for your layout and design. Use them to prompt AI Tutor to generate the HTML and CSS for your app.\r\n\r\nFor the interactive parts of your app, you can write JavaScript yourself, prompt AI Tutor to write it, or both — but remember to evaluate every output before you use it.\r\n\r\nAs you work here:\r\n- Make sure there is always at least one meaningful user action you can test.\r\n- Interact with your app to observe how it behaves in different situations.\r\n- Revise your code to improve clarity, reliability, usability, or correctness.\r\n- Use what you learn here to inform your explanations, reflections, and decisions in other milestones.\r\n\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use Web Lab to build and test a working version of your app. Return to this level whenever you need to test or iterate on your app as it evolves. ***(supports completing Milestone 3)***.",
